    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Obligation";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Duty to apply for magistrate order if not returned";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(b) The thing has not been returned to the owner by the end of the 90th day;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The Commissioner must apply to a magistrate for an order under section 3ZQZB.";
