    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Establishes a recurring trace of the association and the conduct.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(c) the second person engages, or proposes to engage, in conduct (the second person’s conduct) that constitutes, or is part of conduct constituting, an offence against any law;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The association and the conduct are recurring traces.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::temporal_ltl";
